      "message": "\u003e \u003e I opted to keep the same behaviour\n\u003e \n\u003e Looking again now, I might have mixed multi-site and gerrit-core responsabilities, as currently in multi-site we just assume that the project name is an empty string.\n\nMulti-site is neither a core component nor a core plugin, therefore this change should not rely on it.\n\n\u003e Fact remains, that for some code-paths unrelated to issue the project name seems to be empty\n\nWhat are those paths? Can you list them and address them?\n\n\u003e so this might require a bigger refactor which I still think is worth doing but in a separate change.\n\nI believe we should first fix those paths and then enforce the project name to be present.",
